<title>USA: Ronson offers shr exchange.</title>
<headline>Ronson offers shr exchange.</headline>
<dateline>SOMERSET, N.J. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ronson Corp said Thursday it is offering to owners of it 12 percent cumulative convertible preferred stock to exchange their shares for common stock at 1.7 shares of common for each share of preferred.</p>
<p>The company said the exchange offer will expire December 16 ubless extended.</p>
